{"version":1,"content":"<p>本港周六（24日）天晴，早上市區最低氣溫約24°C，新界再低兩三度。</p><p>日間炎熱及非常乾燥，最高氣溫約32°C。</p><p>吹和緩偏北風，離岸風勢間中清勁，高地達強風程度，初時海有湧浪。</p><p>展望下周日（25日）大致天晴及乾燥，日夜溫差仍然較大。</p><p>隨後一兩日部分時間有陽光，下周中期風勢較大。</p><p>(天文台)</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T14:04:40.441010+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:42:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:58:08.607715+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:09.628562+00:00","content_hash":"a8887efa88d6401ecf589c8c179e6de98fd9743c78d734bfe5d99144dccd6737","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}